WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.750
So, how do we build a network? There are
multiple ways you can create a network.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:08.670
The easiest way is to buy a simple
wireless router and connect all of your

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:14.190
devices to that. In this example we have
connected the desktop and printer using

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:18.810
cables and we have connected the laptop
using the wireless connection. So these

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:24.390
three devices can talk among each other
easily using the wireless router. So we

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:25.680
have just created a network.

